> **Note :** These accounts are given simply for testing purposes. There are more accounts to test with, which can be found in the `profiles` table in *Supabase*.   
> These above example accounts were included  to present each level of functionality and allow for comparions between vendors.  
> One admin account is available to verify accounts and view all data on the BoschBites app. There are 3 different Vendor Admin accounts provided to allow for comparison between different vendor admins and hence show the RLS functionality across vendors. Two vendor manager accounts are provided. One aligns with the respective vendor admin account to directly compare the view and functionality between a vendor admin and manager for the same vendor. The second vendor manager account always for comparison between different vendors at a manager level. 
